        <title type="html"><![CDATA[HTMLScriptElement TT updates]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27874</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27874"/>
        <updated>2025-09-15T07:28:32.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">On <code class="notranslate">HTMLScriptElement</code> you can access the <code class="notranslate">innerText</code> and <code class="notranslate">textContent</code> properties. We had documented these as inherited, but in fact they are duplicated and have their own IDL <a href="https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#dom-htmlscriptelement-innertext" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#dom-htmlscriptelement-innertext</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This change makes that more clear, and makes the data more usable.</p>
<p dir="auto">I'll be adding new docs for these too.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2770544982" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/37518/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518">mdn/content#37518</a></p>]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>hamishwillee</name>
            <email>hamishwillee@noreply.github.com</email>
            <uri>https://github.com/hamishwillee</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2025-09-15T07:27:51.000Z</published>
    </entry>
