        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF144 GPUDevice.importExternalTextures() and GPUExternalTexture]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27847</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27847"/>
        <updated>2025-09-15T00:32:40.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">We indicated that support for <code class="notranslate">GPUDevice.importExternalTexture()</code> and <code class="notranslate">GPUExternalTexture</code> was in FF141 in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3253454443" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27372">#27372</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">According to <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1979100#c12" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1979100#c12</a> these were implemented behind a preference in 143, and shipped in FF144 in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1983594" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1983594</a>. Given that FF144 is now in beta I've skipped the 143 and pref feature and just updated these two as released in FF144.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3329620038" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40774" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40774/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40774">mdn/content#40774</a></p>]]></content>
